   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Institutional Partnership for Strengthening       Land Administration (IPSLA) IDN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical cooperation between the National Lan Agency in Indonesia (BPN) and the National Land Survey of Sweden. The cooperation aims at: (1) Improve procedures for demand-driven land registration, (2)support local authorities to provide security of tenure for urban informal settlements, and (3) the development of an integrated urban Land Information System.</narrative>
